க்க, குளிரை வெறுத்துத் தங்குகின்ற பல பூக்களைக் கொண்ட கடற்கரைச் சோலைக்குத் தலைவனான விரிந்த நீரையுடைய சேர்ப்பன் நம்மை விட்டுப் பிரிந்தால், தோழியே! நம்முடைய இனிய உயிரைத் தவிர நாம் இழப்பதற்கு வேறு என்ன இருக்கிறது?","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine talking to her confidante in a neytal (seashore) landscape. The hero has been delaying their marriage, and the heroine expresses her deep anguish at the thought of his separation. She describes the seashore grove where small white water-crows with red mouths huddle together to avoid the cold spray of the waves. This image of the birds seeking comfort together in the cold seashore grove contrasts with her own lonely state, highlighting her vulnerability. She tells her friend that if the lord of this shore leaves her, she has nothing left to lose but her very life. Key words include 'சேர்ப்பன்' (lord of the seashore), 'இன்னுயிர்' (sweet life), and 'இழப்பது' (losing).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.3],[1.37,1.77],[2.03,2.41],[2.41,2.41],[2.41,2.54],[2.54,2.54],[2.54,2.54],[2.54,3.53],[3.7,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,7.91],[7.91,8.59],[8.59,8.59],[8.59,8.7],[8.7,8.93],[8.93,10.1],[10.1,11.0],[11.22,11.9],[11.9,12.2],[12.2,12.89],[12.89,13.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.47,1.87],[2.0,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.55,4.28],[4.28,4.28],[4.28,4.28],[4.28,6.0],[6.0,6.6],[6.6,7.0],[7.0,8.0],[8.0,8.4],[8.4,8.78],[8.78,9.3],[9.3,9.9],[9.9,10.5],[10.5,11.0],[11.28,12.1],[12.1,12.3],[12.3,13.09],[13.09,13.4]]},"sync":[[["சிறு","small"],["வெண்","white"]],[["காக்கை","water-crow"],["செவ்வாய்","red-mouthed"]],[["செவ்வாய்","red-mouthed"]],[["பெருந்தோ","large flock (part)"]],[["டெறிதிரை","throwing wave (part)"]],[["திவலை","spray"]],[["யீர்ம்புற","wet back (part)"]],[["நனைப்பப்","to make wet (part)"]],[["பனி","cold"],["புலந்","disliking (part)"]],[["துறையும்","staying (part)"]],[["பல்பூங்","many flowers (part)"]],[["கானல்","seashore grove"]],[["விரிநீர்","expanding water"]],[["சேர்ப்பன்","lord of the